  "description": "Isolate component errors so one failure does not blank an entire page using errorCallback and graceful fallbacks. NOT for server-side Apex exception design \u2014 use apex/exception-handling. Also covers: normalising error.body across UI API read, UI API write, Apex and network shapes; fallback UI; retry by remount; telemetry hand-off from the boundary.",
